  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Abast. Elctrico Regiones del Pas en Marco Plan Federal Transporte Electricidad</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supply Elec. to Country&apos;s Regions under Federal Electricity Transmission Plan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general del Programa es apoyar y contribuir de manera eficiente el abastecimiento elctrico en las distintas regiones del sistema elctrico argentino. Las obras presentadas permitirn superar los problemas y riesgos que enfrenta el sector de transporte de energa elctrica en la Argentina. Los objetivos especficos del Programa son: (i) recuperar la capacidad de transmisin de energa elctrica a nivel provincial; y (ii) aumentar la eficiencia y confiabilidad del sistema de transmisin y distribucin.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general objective of the Program is to efficiently support and contribute to the supply of electricity to the different regions in the argentinian electric system. The works to be financed will help overcome the problems and risks that the electricity transmission system of Argentina faces. The specific objectives of the Program are to: (i) recover the electricity transmission capacity at the provincial level; and (ii) increase the efficiency and reliability of the transmission and distribution systems.</narrative>
  </description>
